<tab><cl=F0F010>THE BOOK OF MANTRAS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>The mantra book allows you to "memorize" found or acquired mantras. After placing the mantra in this book, your character "remembers" it with some probability, after which he can use the "memorized" mantra repeatedly.<br>
<tab>Each cell in the book of mantras is intended for both "white" mantras that have a positive or neutral effect, and for "black" mantras that have a negative effect.<br>
}